"Reforged"
END

GUI:HudLayout1
"Red Alert Style"
END

TOOLTIP:HudLayout
"Reforged keeps the command bar along the bottom with everything this version adds: the build tabs, the signal keys over the minimap, the production list, the squad list with its build tray, the hero's button, superweapon icons and the general's powers in a tray. Classic is that bar as the original game had it, none of those: the superweapons written out as a name and a time, the general's powers in one column climbing the right edge. Red Alert Style moves building and training into a sidebar down the right, puts the selected units' commands in a strip along the bottom, and takes Red Alert 2's keys where they fit this game: Q W E R for the build tabs, D to deploy, L to sell, K to repair, Z held for waypoints. Reforged and Classic share the game's own keys and Red Alert Style keeps its own; change either on the Hotkeys page."
END

