"Kneels, sets a kamikaze drone down and flies it out to 350, where it drops onto infantry and light vehicles. He sees only 200: past that, a spotter or a radar tower has to find the target. Weak against tanks and buildings. When an enemy your eyes see dies within his reach, he launches half again as fast for 6 seconds. Next to a Siper he reaches a tenth further."
